    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weather Brief – Beirut\n\n7-day outlook from Open-Meteo, formatted as a\nplain-text brief. No API key required.\n\nFlow: fetch -> zip arrays into items -> branch on\n      rain % -> merge -> join into one message\n\nCoords: 33.89, 35.50 · timezone=auto\n\nTips learned here:\n  • Pin the HTTP response, then edit the pinned\n    JSON to test branches reality won't trigger\n  • If node: set the type, or 0 vs \"0\" bites you\n  • Merge must be Append, not Combine\n\nBuilt with n8n · Naji El Kotob",
        "height": 368,
        "width": 496
      },
